  "description": "BlazorGenericTable.MA is a dynamic, feature-rich generic table component designed for C# and Blazor applications. Built on .NET 6 and enhanced by modern C# features like nullable enablement and implicit using, it delivers a seamless and performant experience, empowering developers to present and interact with data effortlessly.\n\n      Designed with both flexibility and clarity in mind, BlazorGenericTable.MA adapts effortlessly to various data models and user interactions. It offers out-of-the-box support for selection, deletion, and pagination functionalities. Additionally, it provides simple mechanisms to edit table styles by allowing you to add custom CSS classes. This makes it easy to tailor your table's appearance, ensuring that your data presentation seamlessly conforms to your application's design language.\n\n      Authored by Mohammad AghaMohammadi and backed by a commitment to quality, this component reflects a blend of technical excellence and refined aesthetics. It’s the ideal choice whether you’re developing complex enterprise solutions or innovative personal projects. Discover a new realm of efficiency and elegance in data management with BlazorGenericTable.MA.\n\n      For more information and to explore additional components, please visit https://github.com/Mohammad-A-m2/BlazorGenericTable.MA or my website at https://m-a-mohammadi.ir/Blogs/Showblog/27/BlazorGenericTable.MA#blog.",
